- Performance: `mergeStatic(group)` bakes each prop/islet group's flat `toon()`/`glow()` parts into one vertex-coloured mesh (mark moving parts `userData.live`); sun shadow map is static (`sun.shadow.autoUpdate = false`, call `bakeShadows()` after changing static geometry), Niko/gems/debris cast no map shadow; draw calls 501 → 163. Loading screen waits for textures + `nikoReady`, then `prewarm()` (compileAsync, texture upload, shadow bake, one hidden render) before `reveal()`. Adaptive resolution steps DPR down by .25 (min .75, never back up) when frames average > 22 ms; `debug.pixelRatio` locks it. `debug.stats()` = ms/calls/triangles; `load-order.mjs` checks Niko is ready before world-ready.

